<title>CHINA: FORECAST - China '96 fixed asset investment seen up.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - China '96 fixed asset investment seen up.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's fixed asset investment is expected to grow by about 20 percent in 1996 to 2.40 trillion yuan ($289.2 billion), the China Securities newspaper said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Retail sales of consumer goods were seen hitting about 2.46 trillion yuan, an increase in real terms of 20 percent from last year, the newspaper said, quoting unidentified sources.</p>
<p>Total foreign trade was forecast to grow by 3.3 percent to $290 billion, it said but gave no further details.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
</text>
